<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 09</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 09. WOUND AND DRESSING CARE RECORD</b><div>Record the assessment of a wound and the dressing care delivered. Complete only for assessed wound care within competence and the agreed care plan. Separate sheet for each wound.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Wound ID / site / side</span><span class="v">{{ v.wound_id_site_side or prefill.wound_id_site_side }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Onset / surgery date</span><span class="v">{{ v.onset_surgery_date or prefill.onset_surgery_date }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Diagnosis / type as documented</span><span class="v">{{ v.diagnosis_type_as_documented or prefill.diagnosis_type_as_documented }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Order / care plan reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.order_care_plan_reference or prefill.order_care_plan_reference }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Consent confirmed</span><span class="v">{{ v.consent_confirmed or prefill.consent_confirmed }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Allergies checked</span><span class="v">{{ v.allergies_checked or prefill.allergies_checked }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Assessment time</span><span class="v">{{ v.assessment_time or prefill.assessment_time }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Wound assessment</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Length cm</span><span class="v">{{ v.length_cm or prefill.length_cm }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Width cm</span><span class="v">{{ v.width_cm or prefill.width_cm }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Depth cm</span><span class="v">{{ v.depth_cm or prefill.depth_cm }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Measurement method / position</span><span class="v">{{ v.measurement_method_position or prefill.measurement_method_position }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Wound bed; edges; surrounding skin; undermining / tunnelling if assessed</span><span class="v">{{ v.wound_bed_edges_surrounding_skin_undermi or prefill.wound_bed_edges_surrounding_skin_undermi }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Exudate amount / type, odour after cleansing and signs of infection or deterioration</span><span class="v">{{ v.exudate_amount_type_odour_after_cleansin or prefill.exudate_amount_type_odour_after_cleansin }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Pain score / tool before</span><span class="v">{{ v.pain_score_tool_before or prefill.pain_score_tool_before }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">After care</span><span class="v">{{ v.after_care or prefill.after_care }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Other relevant observations</span><span class="v">{{ v.other_relevant_observations or prefill.other_relevant_observations }}</span></div><h3>Care delivered</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Cleansing, dressing / products, technique and applicable clinical order</span><span class="v">{{ v.cleansing_dressing_products_technique_an or prefill.cleansing_dressing_products_technique_an }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Tolerance, response, concerns and escalation</span><span class="v">{{ v.tolerance_response_concerns_and_escalati or prefill.tolerance_response_concerns_and_escalati }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Advice, protection / offloading, caregiver role and understanding checked</span><span class="v">{{ v.advice_protection_offloading_caregiver_r or prefill.advice_protection_offloading_caregiver_r }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Photograph taken:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.photograph_taken == "No" else "☐" }} No</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.photograph_taken == "Yes, with separate clinical permission (Form 05, Part D)" else "☐" }} Yes, with separate clinical permission (Form 05, Part D)</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Image reference and secure location</span><span class="v">{{ v.image_reference_and_secure_location or prefill.image_reference_and_secure_location }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Next dressing / review date</span><span class="v">{{ v.next_dressing_review_date or prefill.next_dressing_review_date }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Responsible clinician</span><span class="v">{{ v.responsible_clinician or prefill.responsible_clinician }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Referral / contact and time if indicated</span><span class="v">{{ v.referral_contact_and_time_if_indicated or prefill.referral_contact_and_time_if_indicated }}</span></div><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table></body></html>